	<row id="msg_0525_T10R0401_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m BRUNO of the Elite Four!\rI train to the EXTREME. Seven days\na week. Leg day EVERY day.\rMy homies drink protein shakes\nfor breakfast, lunch, and dinner.\rHm? You ain’t scared? Your eyes\nsay you hungry. PERFECT for a scrap!\rReady, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rYou gon’ BOW to our\noverwhelmin’ GAINS!\rHOO HAH! *flexes*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0525_T10R0401_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I lost... I got no right to\nsay nothin’... *flexes sadly*\fGo face your next challenge!\r</language>
	</row>
